T0043: `encode` needs `T` to be a `Json`, and `Thing` isn't one: no `toJson` in scope takes `Thing`
    interfaces_support.json.toJson(Int) takes `Int` there, not `Thing`
    `interfaces_support.things` has a `toJson(Thing)` that would fit; list it in the import of `interfaces_support.things` to use that one
